faction_ra2_consortium =
   .name = Steel Consortium
   .description = Steel Consortium from Reign of Steel Mod
      The Steel Consortium is an advanced technological faction that combines
      shield technology, quantum weapons, nanite regeneration, and underwater
      operations. Their units are among the most durable in the game thanks to
      personal shields, nanite infusion, and ferrocrete armor. The Consortium
      excels at late-game tech rushing with devastating quantum railguns and
      orbital strikes.

      In Cameo, the Steel Consortium is a high-tech, high-cost faction where
      every vehicle has a personal shield generator. Their Quantum weapons fire
      railgun projectiles that can be upgraded to deal EMP damage. The promotion
      tree teleports in Federation support units (Cougars, Hummers, Quantum Tanks,
      Cobras). Nanite Infusion provides passive regeneration and damage reduction
      to all units and buildings. Their Orbital Cannon superweapon fires an
      enhanced Ion Cannon strike.

      Difficulty: ©©©©©
      Early Game: ©©
      Mid Game: ©©©©
      Late Game: ©©©©©
      Playstyle: Tech Rush / Shields / Quantum Weapons
      Strength: Shields on All Vehicles, Quantum Railguns, Nanite Regeneration, Underwater Transit
      Weakness: Early Game, High Unit Cost, Complex Tech Tree
      Countered by: Early Aggression, EMP Weapons, Air Rushes

      Special Units: Katy Tank (amphibious dual-cannon superheavy with shields),
        Stalker (hover hero with railgun, shields, MC immune), White Rabbit (hover
        hero with gatling weapon, shields, MC immune), Defenderbot, Clone Trooper,
        Cougar, Hummer, Beta Quantum Tank, Cobra
      Special Buildings: Orbital Cannon Activator (Ion Cannon), Consortium Battle Lab,
        EMP Cannon, Naval Yard
      Team Upgrades: Shield Resistance (+25% shield capacity, team upgrade)
      Tech Upgrades: Pulse Weapons (+30% firepower, +15% range for bullets),
        Nanite Infusion (faster regen, -5% damage taken, double for infantry),
        Ferrocrete Curtain (+15% damage resistance for vehicles/buildings),
        Resonance Ammo (bullets ricochet between targets, +10% range),
        Quantum Weapon Power (EMP effect on all quantum weapons, +damage),
        Scalpel Defenders (spawns defense drones for defensive structures),
        Unlock EMP Cannon (support power from Battle Lab)
      Support powers: EMP Cannon, Federation Support Teleport (via promotions)
      Superweapons: Orbital Cannon (enhanced Ion Cannon)

      Features:
      - Personal shields on all vehicles (Shielded trait with regeneration)
      - Quantum weapons: railgun projectiles with EMP upgrade capability
      - Nanite Infusion: passive regeneration + damage reduction for all units/buildings
      - Ferrocrete Curtain: +15% damage resistance for all vehicles and buildings
      - Underwater transit: vehicles can traverse water
      - Pulse Weapons: +30% firepower and +15% range for all bullet weapons
      - Resonance Ammo: bullets ricochet between targets for additional damage
      - Scalpel Defenders: spawns autonomous defense drones for defensive structures
      - Promotion tree teleports in Federation support units (4 tiers)
      - Stalker: hover hero with railgun, shield, mind-control immune
      - White Rabbit: hover hero with gatling weapon, shield, mind-control immune
      - Katy Tank: amphibious superheavy tank with dual cannons and shields
      - Clone Trooper: basic infantry with resonance ammo upgrade capability
      - Orbital Cannon: enhanced Ion Cannon superweapon with larger target circle
      - EMP Cannon: support power that disables vehicles in target area
